  "Yearly fee as published by the issuer. Funds with no fee on file are left out.": "Frais annuels tels que publiés par l'émetteur. Les fonds sans frais connus sont exclus.",
  "Yearly fee from {fee}%": "Frais annuels à partir de {fee} %",
